げる、激昂しヒステリーを起こす、執着するもののために命を省みない行動をする、等危うい言動が目立ちます。\n\nシチュエーションですが霊霊霊様のほの暗く少し不気味な雰囲気のイラストが大好きなので構図等は全てお任せしたいです！表情は笑顔でお願い致します。(笑顔だったら満面の笑みでも含み笑いでも泣き笑いでもなんでもいいです！イラストの雰囲気に合わせて好きに笑わせてやってください)\n\n長文、乱文な上かなり細かくて申し訳ございません！宜しくお願い致します。\n\nhttps://www.uchinokomato.me/chara/show/248596", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 899508, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "よしお", "screen_name": "scomsio", "avatar_url": "https://proxy.misskeyusercontent.jp/avatar/media.misskeyusercontent.jp%2Fio%2F1643ff31-9fe7-49c5-a8d6-74e745d202d0.png%3Fsensitive%3Dtrue?avatar=1", "header_url": "https://media.misskeyusercontent.jp/io/a2332b22-d895-43ee-8c7f-713a5d903a09.png", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": 74, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 3, "complete_expiration_days": 14, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 33}, {"id": 1224025, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "ささみa.k.a.アーキー乃々良", "screen_name": "sasaminosousaku", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2052370215036686336/LlXn8rZp.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1156166651580076032/1776130336/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 17}, {"id": 1453908, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "一期崎", "screen_name": "ichigojaki", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2046842706228633600/YvP8lJyI.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1324219879906406401/1776319541/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": n